name: sim.setLinkDummy
description: Defines (or breaks) a dummy-dummy link pair. Useful to create dynamic loop closure constraints on the fly (among others)
luaSynopsis: sim.setLinkDummy(int dummyHandle, int linkedDummyHandle)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setLinkDummy(int dummyHandle, int linkedDummyHandle)
inputs:
1. dummyHandle: handle of the first dummy in the dummy-dummy link pair
2. linkedDummyHandle: handle of the second dummy in the dummy-dummy link pair. Set to -1 to unlink the first dummy
outputs:
